'''Raw web snippers''' are Dungeoneering fish that can be obtained by fishing them, buying them from the [[Smuggler]], or after being dropped from the various monsters found in [[Daemonheim]]. Level 50 [[Fishing]] is required to catch these fish in the various fish pools provided, granting 99 Fishing experience when caught. Level 50 [[Cooking]] is required to cook the fish, granting 124 Cooking experience; once cooked, they may be eaten to restore up to 1250 life points.

Selling a raw web snipper to the smuggler will net you 450 coins. On the other hand, after it's been cooked, it will be worth 540 coins, so cooking these may net you more money over the raw web snippers, provided they aren't burned.

